ine-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/202607120322052626_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/202607120322052626_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-13/6a53edf8b7fa7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">泰晤士：巴洛贡缓刑仅由纪律委员会主席1人裁决 未让其余成员参与</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260707/6a4c51435f2c6.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260707/6a4c51435f2c6.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260707/6a4c51435f2c6.jpg"> </div><p>据《泰晤士报》报道，美国前锋巴洛贡禁赛处罚延期这一争议性决定，完全由国际足联纪律委员会主席穆罕默德·卡迈利独自作出，其余17名委员会成员均未被要求参与此案。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-13/6a53cc114da2fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">FIFA实力榜：姆巴佩进攻第1，奥利塞创造力第1，罗德里防守第1</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/202607130134242640.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/202607130134242640.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/202607130134242640.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯1/4决赛结束，FIFA官方更新实力排行榜，三个关键表现维度中，进攻维度姆巴佩仍居第一，奥利塞依旧在创造力维度保持第1，罗德里重回防守维度第1。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-13/6a53f2f37ccb2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马卡报：乌拉圭足协主席确认弗兰将执教乌拉圭，签约到2027年3月</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.48" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_190807/5d4ae6150c1e6.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.48" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.48" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_190807/5d4ae6150c1e6.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_190807/5d4ae6150c1e6.jpg"> </div><p>据西班牙《马卡报》报道，乌拉圭足协主席伊格纳西奥·阿隆索已经确认，弗兰将出任乌拉圭国家队主教练。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-13/6a53d2f471c71native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">6527410人！FIFA官方：本届世界杯现场观赛球迷比前两届相加还多</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260713/202607130146583041.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260713/202607130146583041.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260713/202607130146583041.jpg"> </div><p>国际足联官方消息，本届世界杯的现场观赛人数已超过此前两届总和，总计6527410人。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-13/6a54164b3f974native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿根廷vs瑞士赛中及赛后庆祝时至少有2人丧生，其中1人背部中3枪</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32fce21aa5f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32fce21aa5f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32fce21aa5f.jpg"> </div><p>在世界杯1/4决赛，阿根廷3-1战胜瑞士，成功晋级四强。比赛期间和赛后庆祝时，至少有2人丧生。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-13/6a5418a045e2enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿斯：因凡蒂诺希望2030世界杯决赛安排在伯纳乌，皇马已和他接触</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250516/682711172a4c5.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250516/682711172a4c5.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250516/682711172a4c5.jpg"> </div><p>阿斯报报道，在国家队赛事间隙，随着相关报道热度的回落，关于2030年世界杯的传闻开始逐渐增多。</p><p><strong>【其他资讯】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-13/6a53c11ae5095native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG soon！罗马诺：枪手确认与贝西克塔斯就特罗萨德达2000万协议</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/202607130041119400_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/202607130041119400_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/202607130041119400_720.jpg"> </div><p>据罗马诺消息，阿森纳确认与土超球队贝西克塔斯就特罗萨德达2000万欧协议，只等特罗萨德最终批准。这笔交易很快会Here We Go！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-13/6a53f2af2d2a7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：37岁索默自由身加盟布鲁日，已达成短期合同协议</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/202607130403178958_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/202607130403178958_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/202607130403178958_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺以标志性的“Here We Go”确认，前国米门将、37岁的索默将自由身加盟比甲球队布鲁日。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-13/6a53f4be4fd64native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德天空：阿斯顿维拉签曼赞比达全面协议，转会费总价接近7000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.84" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260713/202607130413058436.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.84" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.84" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260713/202607130413058436.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260713/202607130413058436.jpg"> </div><p>据德国天空体育报道，瑞士国脚曼赞比即将加盟阿斯顿维拉，后者已经和弗赖堡达成了全面协议。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-13/6a53d2d7575adnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：曼联告知马赛不会触发青木回购，将通过二转收获1000万镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260713/202607130146444143.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_